WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

2
00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:15.140
Coming here to die? What idiots.

3
00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:16.725
Fighting with you is boring.

4
00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.601
Come together.

5
00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.689
I don't even know
which is the magic beast.

6
00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:27.944
Song is as strong as a monster too.

7
00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:35.452
It's about done here.

8
00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:38.204
Sung. you've really gotten stronger.

9
00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:40.957
Where did you get that great dagger?

10
00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.627
Jinwoo.

11
00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:47.005
I haven't had a chance to heal you today.

12
00:00:47.088 --> 00:00:48.840
Ah... Is it?

13
00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:51.468
I hope you won't need it this time.

14
00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.928
No. I'm counting on you.

15
00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:55.388
Just as I thought.

16
00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:56.639
He has changed a lot.

17
00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.726
Not just his appearance.
but even his aura.

18
00:00:59.809 --> 00:01:02.062
I can feel his ease and confidence.

19
00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:04.439
Did you learn martial arts?

20
00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:07.025
Let's keep going.

21
00:02:40.076 --> 00:02:41.161
It's a fork of the road.

22
00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.038
This one is even easier than expected.

23
00:02:44.122 --> 00:02:46.291
Should we split up into three groups?

24
00:02:46.374 --> 00:02:48.376
Although it will increase the risk.

25
00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:50.461
we could end the mission sooner.

26
00:02:50.545 --> 00:02:52.380
Let's do that.

27
00:02:52.463 --> 00:02:54.382
I'll take the right path
with those convicts.

28
00:02:54.883 --> 00:02:56.759
If you find the BOSS room.

29
00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:58.303
please inform me immediately.

30
00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:01.222
It must be because
my perception has improved.

31
00:03:01.306 --> 00:03:02.724
From here. I can feel

32
00:03:03.766 --> 00:03:05.351
that the boss is ahead on this path.

33
00:03:06.311 --> 00:03:08.646
I can't earn many points
from fighting goblins.

34
00:03:09.564 --> 00:03:10.648
Mr. Song.

35
00:03:10.732 --> 00:03:12.567
Let's take the left path.

36
00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:13.943
I got it.

37
00:03:14.027 --> 00:03:15.570
Then we'll take the middle one.

38
00:03:15.653 --> 00:03:16.529
Yes.

39
00:03:27.832 --> 00:03:30.168
I can handle goblins of this level.

40
00:03:30.752 --> 00:03:32.962
I hope the mission will end well.

41
00:03:33.463 --> 00:03:34.505
It should.

42
00:03:35.506 --> 00:03:39.093
They brought the weakest hunter.
so the level of this dungeon must be low.

43
00:03:39.177 --> 00:03:43.348
We thought so last time. didn't we?

44
00:03:45.934 --> 00:03:46.768
I've decided.

45
00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.020
Once this mission is over.

46
00:03:49.103 --> 00:03:51.314
I will go apologize to Sung.

47
00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:52.232
Eh?

48
00:03:53.107 --> 00:03:54.901
You couldn't forget it either. right?

49
00:03:55.401 --> 00:03:56.986
We ran away.

50
00:03:57.862 --> 00:04:00.198
A man who prides himself
as a hunter ran away.

51
00:04:00.949 --> 00:04:03.076
{\an8}I did it for my family.

52
00:04:03.159 --> 00:04:04.410
{\an8}but it doesn't change the fact

53
00:04:04.494 --> 00:04:06.829
{\an8}that I abandoned my companion.

54
00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:09.415
{\an8}If I want to continue
claiming to be a hunter.

55
00:04:09.499 --> 00:04:11.042
{\an8}I must learn to admit my mistakes.

56
00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:15.129
Will he forget us?

57
00:04:15.838 --> 00:04:17.257
He will never forget us.

58
00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:20.176
But I still have to apologize.

59
00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.552
Alright. let's go.

60
00:04:24.138 --> 00:04:25.932
Too weak.

61
00:04:26.015 --> 00:04:28.017
Goblins are no match at all.

62
00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:29.519
Finished them all?

63
00:04:29.602 --> 00:04:31.187
It's a piece of cake.

64
00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:33.606
I'm not even satisfied.

65
00:04:35.525 --> 00:04:37.819
What if they were humans?

66
00:04:37.902 --> 00:04:38.820
What?

67
00:04:38.903 --> 00:04:40.530
Can you do the same?

68
00:04:41.781 --> 00:04:43.992
Humans aren't that different
from these magic beasts.

69
00:04:44.075 --> 00:04:46.286
Yeah. they're all the same.

70
00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.080
What do you want from me?

71
00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:54.252
Three men violated my daughter.

72
00:04:54.335 --> 00:04:56.504
She hanged herself.

73
00:04:56.587 --> 00:04:58.923
My wife ended up in a mental
hospital due to the trauma.

74
00:04:59.007 --> 00:05:00.758
But those three guys

75
00:05:00.842 --> 00:05:04.429
will be released in a few years
as if nothing had happened.

76
00:05:04.512 --> 00:05:05.972
And they...

77
00:05:06.055 --> 00:05:08.016
They still have their hunter licenses.

78
00:05:08.099 --> 00:05:10.476
I've heard that
hunters can get sentence reductions

79
00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.645
by participating in raid missions.

80
00:05:13.646 --> 00:05:15.565
It's not fair at all.

81
00:05:15.648 --> 00:05:18.443
My daughter will never return to me.

82
00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:22.405
What is that?

83
00:05:22.488 --> 00:05:24.907
Here's three billion.

84
00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:27.994
Please

85
00:05:28.745 --> 00:05:30.371
Kill them for me.

86
00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:36.294
No outsider would know what
happened in the dungeon. right?

87
00:05:36.377 --> 00:05:37.420
I beg you.

88
00:05:37.503 --> 00:05:39.589
Please help me.

89
00:05:42.425 --> 00:05:45.845
After leaving here. I'll report to
the Surveillance Department

90
00:05:46.429 --> 00:05:48.389
that the three of you

91
00:05:48.473 --> 00:05:51.309
encountered a hundred goblins here.

92
00:05:52.977 --> 00:05:55.229
This path is really winding.

93
00:05:55.313 --> 00:05:57.106
Are we really going forward?

94
00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.358
Did we choose the wrong path?

95
00:05:59.442 --> 00:06:01.027
Phew.

96
00:06:03.571 --> 00:06:05.198
Help...

97
00:06:05.281 --> 00:06:07.533
{\an8}Don't expect a quick death.

98
00:06:08.076 --> 00:06:11.120
{\an8}I'll torture you as much as possible
before ending your lives.

99
00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:12.705
{\an8}That's what I was told to do.

100
00:06:12.789 --> 00:06:14.916
What... what are you doing?

101
00:06:15.792 --> 00:06:17.001
Ah.

102
00:06:17.085 --> 00:06:18.586
The paths are connected?

103
00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:20.046
In other words.

104
00:06:20.129 --> 00:06:23.508
the left path leads to the BOSS room.

105
00:06:23.591 --> 00:06:24.759
That saves me the time for finding it.

106
00:06:24.842 --> 00:06:26.677
Help me...

107
00:06:27.845 --> 00:06:29.806
Although this went
differently than planned...

108
00:06:35.561 --> 00:06:37.688
That Kang Taeshik.

109
00:06:37.772 --> 00:06:39.941
He and his superior from the Surveillance
Department visited me at the hospital.

110
00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:43.528
I hope he doesn't remember me.

111
00:06:45.238 --> 00:06:46.531
Mr. Song.

112
00:06:46.614 --> 00:06:47.949
Okay.

113
00:06:53.204 --> 00:06:54.705
What happened?

114
00:06:57.208 --> 00:06:58.501
Jungho.

115
00:07:01.212 --> 00:07:02.338
Mr. Kang.

116
00:07:15.643 --> 00:07:18.062
Mr. Kim.

117
00:07:18.938 --> 00:07:20.815
Joohee... treat them.

118
00:07:21.441 --> 00:07:23.234
Go treat them!

119
00:07:23.317 --> 00:07:24.485
Yes!

120
00:07:27.697 --> 00:07:29.907
Mr. Kim. pull yourself together.

121
00:07:30.491 --> 00:07:33.119
These wounds were not
caused by magic beasts.

122
00:07:33.828 --> 00:07:35.037
They are caused by sharp blades.

123
00:07:35.121 --> 00:07:35.955
Moreover.

124
00:07:36.038 --> 00:07:38.708
the enemy avoided lethal injuries
to create more wounds.

125
00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:41.002
It's no use.

126
00:07:41.669 --> 00:07:43.671
I can't survive.

127
00:07:43.754 --> 00:07:45.339
What nonsense is that?

128
00:07:46.048 --> 00:07:47.717
You need to be alive.

129
00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:49.218
Don't you have a family?

130
00:07:50.052 --> 00:07:51.512
You must...

131
00:07:51.596 --> 00:07:55.016
You must live no matter what!

132
00:07:55.099 --> 00:07:56.976
Only then can I hate you.

133
00:07:57.852 --> 00:07:59.270
I'm sorry.

134
00:07:59.353 --> 00:08:01.439
I am truly sorry.

135
00:08:01.522 --> 00:08:05.776
I didn't want to apologize like this.

136
00:08:06.486 --> 00:08:10.114
I want to bow my head
and apologize to you.

137
00:08:10.948 --> 00:08:12.033
Sung.

138
00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.076
I am really sorry.

139
00:08:14.952 --> 00:08:17.246
Believe me.

140
00:08:25.755 --> 00:08:26.923
Kim.

141
00:08:36.098 --> 00:08:37.642
Wow.

142
00:08:37.725 --> 00:08:39.060
You're quite agile.

143
00:08:40.686 --> 00:08:43.898
I wanted to take care of the healer first.

144
00:08:45.316 --> 00:08:48.194
{\an8}I didn't expect that move to be blocked.

145
00:08:48.277 --> 00:08:49.445
Mr. Kang.

146
00:08:49.529 --> 00:08:51.030
Did you do this?

147
00:08:51.113 --> 00:08:52.323
What if I did?

148
00:08:52.406 --> 00:08:55.701
{\an8}Aren't you from the Hunter's Association?

149
00:08:55.785 --> 00:08:56.911
{\an8}How could you do this?

150
00:08:56.994 --> 00:08:58.913
{\an8}I've thought of a good story.

151
00:08:59.997 --> 00:09:03.918
I was going to claim that
you were killed by goblins.

152
00:09:04.001 --> 00:09:05.503
But I want to make a change.

153
00:09:06.462 --> 00:09:08.673
These criminals attempted to escape.

154
00:09:08.756 --> 00:09:10.716
They killed you first.

155
00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:15.054
and ambushed me from behind
when I fought the Boss.

156
00:09:15.555 --> 00:09:18.224
However. with their strength.
they couldn't harm me.

157
00:09:18.307 --> 00:09:20.685
In the end. only I survived.

158
00:09:20.768 --> 00:09:23.020
Perfect. isn't it?

159
00:09:23.104 --> 00:09:24.397
You scum.

160
00:09:24.939 --> 00:09:27.024
You can't defeat him.

161
00:09:27.108 --> 00:09:28.317
Let me do it.

162
00:09:29.569 --> 00:09:31.362
Kim. lend me your sword.

163
00:09:32.363 --> 00:09:34.740
It's been a long time since
I've crossed swords with someone.

164
00:09:35.324 --> 00:09:37.326
He is B-rank. higher than me.

165
00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.786
But...

166
00:09:38.869 --> 00:09:42.164
Joohee. can you cast a physical
enhancement spell on me?

167
00:09:42.248 --> 00:09:43.541
Yes.

168
00:09:43.624 --> 00:09:46.961
Assassins usually have low defense.
and that's their weakness.

169
00:09:47.461 --> 00:09:49.046
I must target that.

170
00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:52.758
Even if an old Mage had
his strength enhanced.

171
00:09:52.842 --> 00:09:54.302
it would only backfire.

172
00:09:54.885 --> 00:09:57.096
Right now. I am a swordsman.

173
00:09:59.432 --> 00:10:00.933
You are a Mage.

174
00:10:01.517 --> 00:10:03.894
{\an8}What's the point of picking up a sword?

175
00:10:07.106 --> 00:10:08.899
{\an8}There might be a point.

176
00:10:09.483 --> 00:10:11.027
You have good skills.

177
00:10:11.611 --> 00:10:13.237
Although enhanced.

178
00:10:13.738 --> 00:10:15.656
your movements are
very skilled in themselves.

179
00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.451
Although just for a moment.
Mr. Song caught up to his speed.

180
00:10:19.577 --> 00:10:21.120
If he could be a bit faster...

181
00:10:21.203 --> 00:10:22.622
Your attack is fast and accurate.

182
00:10:23.205 --> 00:10:25.583
You have the ability to attack
with a sword instead of magic.

183
00:10:27.001 --> 00:10:29.045
But that's all there is to it.

184
00:10:33.299 --> 00:10:35.593
That healer is annoying.

185
00:10:35.676 --> 00:10:37.094
{\an8}I should get rid of you first.

186
00:10:41.849 --> 00:10:44.435
Turning your back on a swordsman?

187
00:10:44.518 --> 00:10:47.521
Seems like you're no ordinary old man.

188
00:10:47.605 --> 00:10:50.858
After all. I am the master
of an S-rank hunter.

189
00:10:50.941 --> 00:10:53.027
In terms of swordsmanship.
I won't lose to you.

190
00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:54.570
That being said.

191
00:10:54.654 --> 00:10:56.989
the power you've been granted
is ultimately limited.

192
00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:59.075
A Mage

193
00:10:59.158 --> 00:11:02.703
can never keep up with an Assassin.

194
00:11:07.458 --> 00:11:08.793
Mr. Song.

195
00:11:11.003 --> 00:11:11.837
No.

196
00:11:11.921 --> 00:11:14.799
The healer has exhausted her power.

197
00:11:19.303 --> 00:11:20.721
It's over.

198
00:11:27.937 --> 00:11:28.771
Did it work?

199
00:11:29.271 --> 00:11:33.651
You posed as a swordsman
to lower my guard against the magic.

200
00:11:33.734 --> 00:11:36.445
You unleashed a magical attack
at the moment I made my final strike.

201
00:11:37.446 --> 00:11:39.198
This tactic isn't bad.

202
00:11:39.281 --> 00:11:41.158
{\an8}You cunning old fox.

203
00:11:41.242 --> 00:11:42.827
Is it over?

204
00:11:43.786 --> 00:11:44.870
Die.

205
00:11:50.876 --> 00:11:52.711
You again.

206
00:11:52.795 --> 00:11:53.879
Who are you?

207
00:11:55.047 --> 00:11:56.340
I'm Sung Jinwoo.

208
00:11:57.216 --> 00:11:58.217
{\an8}an E-Rank hunter.

209
00:11:59.552 --> 00:12:00.761
E-rank?

210
00:12:01.554 --> 00:12:02.888
How is that possible?

211
00:12:03.472 --> 00:12:05.057
Sung.

212
00:12:05.141 --> 00:12:06.100
What was that just now?

213
00:12:06.183 --> 00:12:08.519
If you are a power-type E-rank hunter.

214
00:12:08.602 --> 00:12:11.105
that strength would make sense.

215
00:12:11.188 --> 00:12:15.067
But you reacted fast enough
to block my attacks twice.

216
00:12:15.151 --> 00:12:16.694
Are you an Assassin?

217
00:12:16.777 --> 00:12:18.487
Never mind. It doesn't matter.

218
00:12:19.071 --> 00:12:20.781
You've been hiding your true power. right?

219
00:12:21.282 --> 00:12:23.701
You seem to know each other.

220
00:12:23.784 --> 00:12:25.578
Then you can't be a False Ranker.

221
00:12:25.661 --> 00:12:28.038
After all. you wouldn't
leave any witnesses alive.

222
00:12:28.622 --> 00:12:29.665
In that case.

223
00:12:29.748 --> 00:12:31.292
there's only one answer.

224
00:12:32.293 --> 00:12:33.210
{\an8}You're a second awakener.

225
00:12:33.294 --> 00:12:34.462
{\an8}Sung is...

226
00:12:34.545 --> 00:12:36.338
{\an8}A second awakener.

227
00:12:36.422 --> 00:12:37.673
If that's the case.

228
00:12:37.756 --> 00:12:39.758
did it happen after
the double dungeon incident?

229
00:12:40.342 --> 00:12:41.677
Double dungeon?

230
00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.179
Is he

231
00:12:43.262 --> 00:12:45.264
that lousy E-rank hunter?

232
00:12:45.848 --> 00:12:48.934
His appearance and impression
are completely different.

233
00:12:49.018 --> 00:12:51.645
And his measured value was only 10.

234
00:12:52.313 --> 00:12:54.231
Did the second awakening
happen after that?

235
00:12:54.315 --> 00:12:55.232
If so.

236
00:12:55.316 --> 00:12:57.610
how did he survive the double dungeon?

237
00:12:58.194 --> 00:12:59.820
Well. regardless.

238
00:12:59.904 --> 00:13:02.406
it seems you have little
experience as a hunter.

239
00:13:02.907 --> 00:13:06.035
Let me teach you a thing or two.

240
00:13:06.118 --> 00:13:07.620
Why do you do this?

241
00:13:08.204 --> 00:13:09.705
You mean these prisoners?

242
00:13:10.456 --> 00:13:13.209
I was entrusted
by the family of the victim.

243
00:13:13.751 --> 00:13:17.254
They killed someone without any remorse.

244
00:13:17.338 --> 00:13:19.089
I'm doing justice.

245
00:13:19.173 --> 00:13:21.842
No. I mean Mr. Kim and Mr. Kang.

246
00:13:22.426 --> 00:13:23.552
Why did you kill them?

247
00:13:24.261 --> 00:13:26.013
Was it to silence them?

248
00:13:26.096 --> 00:13:27.598
Then you could have made it quick.

249
00:13:28.349 --> 00:13:30.726
Yet you avoided inflicting fatal wounds.

250
00:13:30.809 --> 00:13:32.353
as if to torture them.

251
00:13:33.437 --> 00:13:34.855
It's for the victim?

252
00:13:34.939 --> 00:13:36.148
Cut it out.

253
00:13:36.232 --> 00:13:38.025
That is not your true nature.

254
00:13:40.819 --> 00:13:41.862
Yes.

255
00:13:41.946 --> 00:13:43.948
These things are trivial for me.

256
00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:46.492
But you seem to have misunderstood.

257
00:13:47.034 --> 00:13:51.413
I am a B-rank hunter that
many large guilds fight for.

258
00:13:52.331 --> 00:13:55.042
Why do you think
I joined Hunter's Association

259
00:13:55.125 --> 00:13:56.877
that pays a meager salary?

260
00:13:56.961 --> 00:13:58.629
{\an8}Because

261
00:13:58.712 --> 00:14:00.172
{\an8}compared to killing magic beasts.

262
00:14:00.256 --> 00:14:03.300
{\an8}I enjoy killing people more.

263
00:14:07.054 --> 00:14:09.682
Even with a second awakening.
an E-rank hunter can't be very strong.

264
00:14:11.892 --> 00:14:13.060
You're too slow.

265
00:14:13.143 --> 00:14:14.270
You're quite fast.

266
00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:19.733
How can he have such skills?

267
00:14:19.817 --> 00:14:23.571
He's no longer the Sung I knew.

268
00:14:26.282 --> 00:14:28.325
Our speeds are comparable.

269
00:14:28.409 --> 00:14:30.077
Even if we have the same skills

270
00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.871
and the same strength.

271
00:14:31.954 --> 00:14:34.039
your experience
against high-level opponents

272
00:14:34.123 --> 00:14:35.207
is far too little compared to mine.

273
00:14:35.291 --> 00:14:38.460
These differences will
lead to your defeat.

274
00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:48.012
You are a tough one.

275
00:14:48.095 --> 00:14:49.805
-Excuse me.
-What?

276
00:14:49.889 --> 00:14:52.808
Could you please tone
down your killing intent?

277
00:14:53.851 --> 00:14:55.144
Look.

278
00:14:55.227 --> 00:14:56.979
The system has responded to you.

279
00:14:58.522 --> 00:15:00.524
Now I have to thank this system.

280
00:15:01.108 --> 00:15:04.528
It has given me another reason
why I must kill you.

281
00:15:04.612 --> 00:15:06.322
{\an8}System?

282
00:15:06.405 --> 00:15:07.615
{\an8}What's up with him?

283
00:15:08.198 --> 00:15:10.576
I'm the one with the upper hand.

284
00:15:17.374 --> 00:15:18.626
He got even faster.

285
00:15:19.585 --> 00:15:20.586
It's poison.

286
00:15:20.669 --> 00:15:22.046
Is this a special effect of your dagger?

287
00:15:27.259 --> 00:15:29.929
Then let me show you
something interesting too.

288
00:15:31.931 --> 00:15:32.973
He disappeared.

289
00:15:33.515 --> 00:15:35.643
I had completely concealed my presence.

290
00:15:35.726 --> 00:15:37.353
Your senses are sharp.

291
00:15:37.436 --> 00:15:39.021
Skill Invisibility.

292
00:15:39.605 --> 00:15:42.524
It hides one's shape. sound.
scent. among others.

293
00:15:42.608 --> 00:15:46.695
Even among Assassins.
only a very few can acquire this skill.

294
00:15:46.779 --> 00:15:49.823
Of course. those who know
that I can use this skill

295
00:15:49.907 --> 00:15:51.450
are nonexistent.

296
00:15:51.533 --> 00:15:52.910
After all.

297
00:15:54.912 --> 00:15:56.872
there hasn't been one

298
00:15:56.956 --> 00:15:59.667
who has seen me use this skill
and lived to tell about it.

299
00:16:00.501 --> 00:16:02.169
I have sealed your speed.

300
00:16:02.962 --> 00:16:04.588
-Jinwoo.
-Stay put.

301
00:16:05.839 --> 00:16:08.008
After I kill him. it's your turn.

302
00:16:08.592 --> 00:16:11.011
If this goes on. Sung...

303
00:16:11.095 --> 00:16:15.391
With your foot injured.
can you still dodge my attacks?

304
00:16:15.474 --> 00:16:16.600
Hey.

305
00:16:16.684 --> 00:16:18.185
Have you said enough?

306
00:16:18.936 --> 00:16:19.853
Full Recovery.

307
00:16:22.189 --> 00:16:23.941
He recovered instantly.

308
00:16:24.024 --> 00:16:26.944
A Fighter capable of using healing magic.

309
00:16:27.027 --> 00:16:28.779
I've never heard of such a thing.

310
00:16:28.862 --> 00:16:30.489
How many times can he use it?

311
00:16:30.572 --> 00:16:31.991
I cannot predict it at all.

312
00:16:32.074 --> 00:16:34.076
He's a dangerous one.

313
00:16:34.159 --> 00:16:36.036
I've lost another emotion.

314
00:16:37.037 --> 00:16:38.789
With scum like you.

315
00:16:38.872 --> 00:16:40.791
is it a waste of time to get angry?

316
00:16:42.334 --> 00:16:43.252
I see.

317
00:16:43.919 --> 00:16:45.963
You've done it. right?

318
00:16:47.798 --> 00:16:50.050
You're like me after all.

319
00:16:50.634 --> 00:16:51.885
I see.

320
00:16:51.969 --> 00:16:53.846
He probably had to make

321
00:16:53.929 --> 00:16:56.557
many difficult choices in a short time.

322
00:16:57.141 --> 00:16:59.768
It isn't just his appearance that changed.

323
00:16:59.852 --> 00:17:01.228
Awakening.

324
00:17:01.311 --> 00:17:04.523
This power beyond common sense
has changed the rules of the world.

325
00:17:05.232 --> 00:17:07.735
This is a lawless land
belonging only to hunters.

326
00:17:07.818 --> 00:17:09.528
There is no law here.

327
00:17:09.611 --> 00:17:11.947
only the winner.

328
00:17:17.953 --> 00:17:18.787
Can he be

329
00:17:18.871 --> 00:17:21.331
gauging my position
through my killing intent?

330
00:17:22.124 --> 00:17:24.918
But even so. he still can't
pinpoint my exact location.

331
00:17:29.673 --> 00:17:31.341
What... what's wrong?

332
00:17:33.177 --> 00:17:34.595
Wait.

333
00:17:34.678 --> 00:17:36.013
No way.

334
00:17:39.224 --> 00:17:42.519
How... is it possible?

335
00:17:48.692 --> 00:17:51.612
You asked me why I killed. right?

336
00:17:52.529 --> 00:17:54.907
It's pointless to apply
ordinary people's views

337
00:17:55.449 --> 00:17:58.744
to hunters who frequently
consort with death.

338
00:17:59.411 --> 00:18:00.996
You're the same.

339
00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:05.417
We've both become killing machines.

340
00:18:06.043 --> 00:18:07.086
{\an8}So.

341
00:18:07.169 --> 00:18:09.004
{\an8}I lost and will die.

342
00:18:09.088 --> 00:18:11.507
{\an8}It's the logical rule.

343
00:18:12.424 --> 00:18:14.134
Who are you?

344
00:18:14.718 --> 00:18:16.053
Being an Assassin.

345
00:18:16.136 --> 00:18:18.138
you are capable of using healing magic
and debuff magic.

346
00:18:18.222 --> 00:18:19.473
I've never heard of that.

347
00:18:20.057 --> 00:18:21.183
Well.

348
00:18:21.266 --> 00:18:23.769
I would like to know too.

349
00:18:28.273 --> 00:18:30.317
Since you've killed me.

350
00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:34.154
you can no longer hide your identity.

351
00:18:34.238 --> 00:18:38.325
What if I were the kind of hunter
who grows constantly in battle?

352
00:18:41.328 --> 00:18:43.122
Your shadow

353
00:18:43.747 --> 00:18:45.749
is already connected to the darkness.

354
00:18:46.583 --> 00:18:50.712
Your power will become
as unfathomable as it.

355
00:18:50.796 --> 00:18:53.298
However. you must be careful.

356
00:18:54.133 --> 00:18:56.635
When you stare into the abyss.

357
00:18:57.219 --> 00:19:02.015
the abyss stares back at you.

358
00:19:08.021 --> 00:19:09.106
Indeed.

359
00:19:09.189 --> 00:19:11.942
My strength has grown rapidly.

360
00:19:12.693 --> 00:19:14.153
But I feel

361
00:19:14.987 --> 00:19:16.530
that as my strength grows.

362
00:19:16.613 --> 00:19:20.284
a part of me is gradually falling apart.

363
00:19:20.367 --> 00:19:21.493
Jinwoo.

364
00:19:22.077 --> 00:19:23.787
Thank you.

365
00:19:23.871 --> 00:19:25.497
You saved us.

366
00:19:25.581 --> 00:19:28.167
Without you. we would have died.

367
00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.168
It's nothing.

368
00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.420
Please go ahead and leave.

369
00:19:32.421 --> 00:19:33.755
I need to close up the dungeon.

370
00:19:33.839 --> 00:19:34.673
What?

371
00:19:34.756 --> 00:19:36.133
You're going alone?

372
00:19:36.884 --> 00:19:39.094
No. we'll do as you say.

373
00:19:39.636 --> 00:19:43.140
It's a pity that we can't
bury Kim and Kang.

374
00:19:43.223 --> 00:19:44.641
I'll wait for you outside.

375
00:19:56.653 --> 00:19:57.571
Chief Woo.

376
00:19:58.155 --> 00:19:59.156
I've heard the report.

377
00:19:59.239 --> 00:20:00.115
Where are the survivors?

378
00:20:00.199 --> 00:20:01.283
Over there.

379
00:20:01.867 --> 00:20:02.784
{\an8}Speaking of which.

380
00:20:02.868 --> 00:20:06.580
{\an8}I didn't expect Kang Taeshik
to be involved in murders.

381
00:20:07.581 --> 00:20:09.791
although I did suspect him.

382
00:20:09.875 --> 00:20:12.794
As his superior. I was too careless.

383
00:20:13.795 --> 00:20:15.047
It's these three.

384
00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:18.425
I remember

385
00:20:18.508 --> 00:20:20.219
he was that E-rank hunter back then.

386
00:20:20.886 --> 00:20:22.262
He looks like a different person.

387
00:20:23.388 --> 00:20:24.765
Long time no see.

388
00:20:24.848 --> 00:20:26.642
Um. you're from
the Surveillance Department.

389
00:20:26.725 --> 00:20:27.976
Woo Jinchul.

390
00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:31.313
This time my subordinate
has caused huge trouble.

391
00:20:32.147 --> 00:20:33.523
But first.

392
00:20:33.607 --> 00:20:35.859
let me get straight to the point.

393
00:20:36.443 --> 00:20:38.111
Which of you

394
00:20:38.195 --> 00:20:39.321
killed Kang Taeshik?

395
00:20:39.905 --> 00:20:42.407
It seems I can no longer hide.

396
00:20:43.075 --> 00:20:44.243
It's a pity.

397
00:20:44.326 --> 00:20:47.329
My collaboration with Jinho
might have to come to an end.

398
00:20:48.205 --> 00:20:49.915
It was me.

399
00:20:49.998 --> 00:20:52.709
I killed Mr. Kang.

400
00:20:52.793 --> 00:20:54.878
Excuse me. I remember your rank is...

401
00:20:54.962 --> 00:20:56.546
I'm a C-rank hunter.

402
00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:59.508
How could a C-rank hunter
manage to kill a B-rank hunter?

403
00:21:00.092 --> 00:21:01.760
Because we have her.

404
00:21:03.553 --> 00:21:04.846
I see.

405
00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:07.432
So you managed to defeat him
with the healer's assistance.

406
00:21:08.725 --> 00:21:11.186
Kang Taeshik was among
the top of the B-rank hunters.

407
00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:13.146
I don't think
a C-rank Mage could kill him.

408
00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:14.648
no matter how hard he tried.

409
00:21:16.233 --> 00:21:17.484
I understand.

410
00:21:17.567 --> 00:21:20.487
We need to complete the report.

411
00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:21.947
Please come with me.

412
00:21:22.614 --> 00:21:25.784
{\an8}Now is not the time to be smug
about having killed Kang Taeshik.

413
00:21:26.368 --> 00:21:28.245
I couldn't see it at that time.

414
00:21:28.328 --> 00:21:30.122
This person is an A-rank hunter.

415
00:21:30.205 --> 00:21:32.291
He's not someone I can handle right now.

416
00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:36.712
Was I meddling too much?

417
00:21:37.421 --> 00:21:41.174
You must have your reasons
for hiding your strength.

418
00:21:42.968 --> 00:21:46.638
Alright. Consider it my way of
repaying you for saving my life.

419
00:21:51.268 --> 00:21:52.561
Three hours later.

420
00:21:52.644 --> 00:21:56.356
the man who commissioned Kang Taeshik
to kill the prisoners turned himself in.

421
00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:59.151
The whole case was concluded
as legitimate self-defense.

422
00:22:01.445 --> 00:22:02.821
That was exhausting.

423
00:22:03.864 --> 00:22:04.781
Jinwoo.

424
00:22:06.408 --> 00:22:07.242
Do you

425
00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:10.120
remember this?

425
00:22:11.305 --> 00:23:11.292
